{title: Kya Janoo Sajan}
{artist: Kavita Krishnamurthy Lata Mangeshkar R D Burman}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] [E] [G] [C]
Kya jaanu sajan hoti hai kya gham ki shaam
[C] [E] [F] [Am],        Jal uthe sau diye jab liya tera naam
[Am],        Kya jaanu sajan
[Am] [C] [F],        jab se milee najar mathe peh ban gaye
[F] [G] [E],        bindiya nayan tere dekho sajna
[Am] [C] [F],        dhar lee jo pyar se meree kalaiya
[F] [G] [E],        piya teree ungliya ho gayee kangna
[Am] [C] [F]
Kaanton mein main khadi, nainon ke dwaar pe
[F] [G] [E],        Nis din bahaar ke dekhoon sapne
[Am] [C] [F],        chehere ki dhool kya, chanda ki chaandini
[F] [G] [E],        utri to reh gayi mukh pe apne
